# Miscellaneous
*.class
*.log
*.pyc
*.swp
.DS_Store
.atom/
# .env* 有意**不**忽略：它们是脚手架的非密钥配置（BASE_URL / USE_MOCK），
# 会提交进 git，并由 pubspec.yaml 的 assets 声明打进产物。
# 密钥一律走 --dart-define；不要把 .env* 加回这里 —— 那会让人以为本地改动
# 不会被提交，与 README「环境配置与 release 构建」的说法互相矛盾。
.build/
.buildlog/
.history
.svn/
.swiftpm/
migrate_working_dir/

# IntelliJ related
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.idea/
.trae/
.codebuddy/

# The .vscode folder contains launch configuration and tasks you configure in
# VS Code which you may wish to be included in version control, so this line
# is commented out by default.
#.vscode/

# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
my_app.code-workspace
signals.md
/build/
/coverage/

# 代码生成物：不入库，clone 后跑 `just codegen`。
# 口径与 packages/app_lints 的 isGeneratedPath() 对齐；
# 策略见 .trellis/spec/cross-cutting.md「代码生成与生成物」。
*.g.dart
*.freezed.dart
*.gr.dart
*.config.dart
*.gen.dart
**/gen/
*app_localizations*
# Platform specific
**/ios/Pods/
**/macos/Pods/
**/ios/.symlinks/
**/ios/Flutter/Flutter.framework
**/ios/Flutter/Flutter.podspec
**/ios/Flutter/App.framework
**/windows/flutter/ephemeral/
**/windows/flutter/ephemeral/**/.dart_tool
**/windows/flutter/ephemeral/**/.flutter-plugins-dependencies

# Android KeyStore
**/android/key.properties
*.jks
*.keystore

# FVM
.fvm/flutter_sdk

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release
